# 🌐 Frans Portfolio Website

## 📌 Overview
This is a simple personal portfolio website built using basic HTML and CSS.  
The website introduces who I am, my background, skills, experience, and projects.

The design focuses on:
- Clean layout
- Easy navigation
- Simple styling



---

## ✨ Features Implemented

### 🔹 General Design
- Simple and clean UI
- Consistent brown color theme
- Easy navigation bar

### 🔹 Home Section
- Introduction text
- Profile image
- Button with hover effect

### 🔹 About Section
- Short biography
- Skills list
- Clean spacing

### 🔹 Experience Section
- Card layout
- Hover effect (lift animation)

### 🔹 Projects Section
- Project cards
- Gradient background
- Hover effect on links

### 🔹 Contact Section
- Simple contact form
- Styled inputs and button

### 🔹 Footer
- Gradient background
- Centered text

### 🔹 CSS Styling Features
- Flexbox layout
- Responsive design using media queries
- Hover effects:
  - Buttons
  - Cards
  - Images
  - Links
- Gradient elements (navbar, footer, project)

---

## 🛠️ Technologies Used

- HTML5   
- Flexbox  
- Media Queries  

---

## 📱 Responsive Design

This website works on:
- Desktop 💻  
- Tablet 📱  
- Mobile 📱  

